  47:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c **** /** @file s_whois.c  Send a Who-Is request. */
  48:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c **** 
  49:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c **** /** Send a Who-Is request to a remote network for a specific device, a range,
  50:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c ****  * or any device.
  51:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c ****  * If low_limit and high_limit both are -1, then the range is unlimited.
  52:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c ****  * If low_limit and high_limit have the same non-negative value, then only
  53:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c ****  * that device will respond.
  54:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c ****  * Otherwise, low_limit must be less than high_limit.
  55:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c ****  * @param target_address [in] BACnet address of target router
  56:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c ****  * @param low_limit [in] Device Instance Low Range, 0 - 4,194,303 or -1
  57:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c ****  * @param high_limit [in] Device Instance High Range, 0 - 4,194,303 or -1
  58:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/s_whois.c ****  */
